	<h2>Data & Evidence Ingestion Portal</h2>
	<p>
		ErrorLedger functions as an independent, evidence-grounded systems analysis engine. If you are an engineer, researcher, or systems practitioner with verified telemetry, controlled study data, or post-mortem documentation, we accept submissions.
	</p>

	<h3>Sourcing Verification Standard</h3>
	<p>
		To maintain analysis integrity, all external submissions must provide verifiable primary sources. This includes official post-mortems, kernel logs, commit histories, peer-reviewed study DOIs, or clinical trial registry entries.
	</p>

	<h3>Submit a Record for Investigation</h3>
	<p>
		To propose a system failure for forensic analysis, or to submit verified telemetry and evidence datasets, contact our editorial team:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Communication Node:</strong> contact@errorledger.com</li>
	</ul>
